{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>If now I have found favor in your eyes.</b> If you have loved me as befits our close kinship, it is not fitting that you leave me. For I have divined that blessing has come to my house on your account, in the increase of livestock and other assets, as they said (Berakhot 42a): blessing comes immediately upon a sage." "<b>And YHWH has blessed me on your account.</b> And I have also seen that I have derived from the livestock much wealth and more profit than usual, and I know that this was on your account — and perhaps the teraphim spoke this."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:32:33.410465100Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}